## Positive Patterns
- ✅ `[GeneratedRegex]` used for 3 core patterns under `#if NET7_0_OR_GREATER` (L13, L16, L19)
- ✅ `RegexOptions.Compiled` fallback for pre-.NET 7 targets (L26-28)
- ✅ `IsAllUpperCase` uses `foreach` loop instead of LINQ `.All()` (L159)
- ✅ `Slugify` uses `.ToLowerInvariant()` correctly (L189)
- ✅ `IsAsciiAlphanumeric` / `WordCount` use allocation-free `foreach` loops

